- You must not reverse engineer, decompile, disassemble, modify or attempt to extract the source code of the program's own components. This does not apply where applicable law expressly allows it, nor to third-party components whose licenses allow it (see section 4).
- You must not sell, rent, sublicense or use the Software in paid commercial products, or include it in paid bundles or ad-supported installers, without the copyright holder's written permission.
